    "name": "Riding Drake",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your companion is a riding drake.</p>\n<p><strong>Support Benefit</strong> Your drake snorts fire in your foes' faces. Until the start of your next turn, each time you Strike while riding the drake and hit a creature in the drake's reach, the creature takes 1d4 fire damage from the drake. If your drake is nimble or savage, the fire damage increases to 2d4.</p>\n<p><strong>Advanced Maneuver</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.companion-types.Item.Fire Breath]{Fire Breath}</p>\n<p><strong>Special</strong> The riding drake has the dragon trait instead of the animal trait, and it has the mount special ability.</p>"
